ind":"announcement","title":"Online Play is here!","summary":"Biggest update yet!The question I heard most often when it came to Touchdown was whether there will be Online play. Initially I didn't intend it, but happily most of the game was already designed as a multiplayer, so the last few weeks I spent implementing proper Online play mechanics, and I'm happy to announce:Touchdown is no longer couch-only. You can now play with friends over the internet or on your local network. Menus have been completely rebuilt to support the long list of new features re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T17:05:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682414","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4756470-1844751498227586","game_id":"steam-4756470","kind":"announcement","title":"Remote Play Support!","summary":"Quick UpdateThe DEMO version has been out for a few days now and it just received an update!You can now play with your friends online via Steam Remote Play!It supports both Gamepads and Keyboard & Mouse!Steam Remote Play supports up to 4 players only - this is Steam's limitation.There's a few more Quality of Life changes and bug fixes!More detailsThe first Demo version (0.5.0) only supported Steam Remote Play for gamepads. Connecting with a keyboard resulted in a bug where both players would con","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T16:52:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498227586","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4756470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:06:50Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attem